            "kind": "NO_CODE_CHANGE",
            "comments": [
                {
                    "file": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
                    "line": 0,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Jason Westover",
                        "email": "jwestover@nvidia.com",
                        "username": "j-westover"
                    },
                    "message": "+1 \u2014 Correct fix for #125.\n\nOptional follow-ups (non-blocking):\n- Reconcile selectedInterfaceIndex from selectedInterfaceId after refresh\n- Reset selection if stored ID is no longer in the refreshed interface list\n- Unit test for getEthernetData selection behavior"
                },
                {
                    "file": "src/store/modules/Settings/NetworkStore.js",
                    "line": 79,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Jason Westover",
                        "email": "jwestover@nvidia.com",
                        "username": "j-westover"
                    },
                    "message": "`getEthernetData()` does not update `selectedInterfaceIndex` after\nrefresh. Today that stays in sync via `Network.vue`'s tabIndex watcher, but\nreconciling `index` from `selectedInterfaceId` after refresh would make save\nactions that index into ethernetData more robust if member order ever\nchanges."
                },
                {
                    "file": "src/store/modules/Settings/NetworkStore.js",
                    "line": 79,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Aravinth Sri Krishna Raja Raghavan",
                        "email": "aravinths@ami.com",
                        "username": "aravinths1"
                    },
                    "message": "Done. getEthernetData() now reconciles selectedInterfaceIndex directly from selectedInterfaceId after each refresh using interfaceIds.indexOf(selectedId), making it robust against member order changes."
                },
                {
                    "file": "src/store/modules/Settings/NetworkStore.js",
                    "line": 104,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Jason Westover",
                        "email": "jwestover@nvidia.com",
                        "username": "j-westover"
                    },
                    "message": "Consider the interface list can change while the\npage is open:\n```\n  const interfaceIds = ethernetData.map((iface) => iface.Id);\n  if (\n    state.selectedInterfaceId === '' ||\n    !interfaceIds.includes(state.selectedInterfaceId)\n  ) {\n    commit('setSelectedInterfaceId', firstInterfaceId);\n  }\n```"
                },
                {
                    "file": "src/store/modules/Settings/NetworkStore.js",
                    "line": 104,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Aravinth Sri Krishna Raja Raghavan",
                        "email": "aravinths@ami.com",
                        "username": "aravinths1"
                    },
                    "message": "Done. Extended the guard to also reset selection if the stored interface ID is no longer in the refreshed list:"
                }
            ],
